WEBVTT

00:01.440 --> 00:03.940
<i>My new life in Rotsgard.</i>

00:04.910 --> 00:08.030
<i>Having finally acquired permission 
to open a new store,</i>

00:08.790 --> 00:11.460
<i>Misumi Makoto unexpectedly 
becomes a teacher</i>

00:11.460 --> 00:14.910
<i>and receives his official 
acceptance letter, but...</i>

00:15.520 --> 00:18.830
The academy has summoned you 
rather abruptly, hasn't it?

00:18.830 --> 00:20.180
Tell me about it.

00:20.180 --> 00:22.650
But I don't have to be there 
until this afternoon.

00:22.650 --> 00:24.750
We'll be right on time if we go after lunch.

00:24.750 --> 00:26.710
<b></b>Gotetsu Restaurant

00:24.750 --> 00:26.710
<b></b>Gotetsu Restaurant

00:26.980 --> 00:30.050
Kuzunoha-san, welcome.

00:30.900 --> 00:32.550
<i>Hello, Luria.</i>

00:32.550 --> 00:34.570
<i>We'll be stopping by again today.</i>

00:34.570 --> 00:36.600
We appreciate your business.

00:36.600 --> 00:38.500
Shiki-san, would you like 
your regular hot pot?

00:38.750 --> 00:40.630
Yes, of course.

00:40.630 --> 00:42.850
<i>Maybe I'll get the chicken hot pot today.</i>

00:43.250 --> 00:45.060
You two are unusual.

00:45.060 --> 00:48.050
Usually a group of people 
will share a single hot pot.

00:48.520 --> 00:49.840
I'll show you to your table.

00:49.840 --> 00:52.140
I'm so excited.

00:52.380 --> 00:54.820
<i>This is our fifth day in 
a row eating at Gotetsu.</i>

00:55.220 --> 00:58.530
<i>Shiki has become weirdly 
obsessed with the place.</i>

00:58.530 --> 01:03.960
Damn it. They're always 
showing up around Luria.

01:04.850 --> 01:06.930
You're Ilumgand-sama, aren't you?

01:07.710 --> 01:11.530
Don't worry. I'm a student at the academy.

01:11.530 --> 01:14.570
There's something I'd like 
to discuss with you.

01:38.990 --> 01:41.530
<b>Season Two</b>

02:46.140 --> 02:50.390
<b>Night Five     The Lesson Will Now Begin</b>

02:46.140 --> 02:50.390
<b>Night Five     The Lesson Will Now Begin</b>

02:46.890 --> 02:48.360
Thank you for waiting.

02:48.630 --> 02:50.540
Here are the hot pots you ordered.

02:52.170 --> 02:54.890
<i>Shiki's new obsession: cream hot pot.</i>

02:57.030 --> 02:59.430
Nothing beats this sweetness.

02:59.430 --> 03:02.180
<i>Meat and vegetables in 
a super-sweet cream...</i>

03:03.700 --> 03:07.760
Come to think of it, you work 
at the academy, don't you?

03:08.330 --> 03:10.690
<i>Yeah. I'm heading there after this.</i>

03:11.030 --> 03:12.820
In that case, when you get there, my—

03:12.820 --> 03:14.720
Luria, could you help me over here?

03:14.720 --> 03:17.500
Oh, no. The place is getting busy.

03:17.930 --> 03:20.140
Well, take your time.

03:20.760 --> 03:22.580
<i>Thanks.</i>

03:22.580 --> 03:23.600
Young Master.

03:24.010 --> 03:26.320
May I order seconds?

03:26.320 --> 03:28.510
<i>Shiki, is there something 
wrong with your blood sugar?</i>

03:29.060 --> 03:31.020
<b>Komoe</b>

03:31.020 --> 03:33.980
<b></b>Rotsgard Academy

03:31.020 --> 03:33.980
<b></b>Rotsgard Academy

03:31.620 --> 03:33.970
Those are all the employee regulations.

03:34.200 --> 03:40.570
As long as you don't exchange money on 
academy grounds, there's no problem.

03:40.570 --> 03:42.680
<i>So promoting my shop is okay.</i>

03:43.070 --> 03:47.450
Currently, the academy employs 
several hundred faculty members.

03:47.450 --> 03:51.410
Teachers are paid ten 
silver coins per student.

03:51.940 --> 03:57.030
Part-time teachers can lecture 
to up to 30 students at once.

03:57.650 --> 04:00.620
Is next week all right 
for your first lecture?

04:01.100 --> 04:01.870
<i>Yes.</i>

04:02.300 --> 04:05.180
<i>I'm planning to hold a lecture 
for fewer than ten students,</i>

04:05.180 --> 04:07.100
<i>and starting next week should be no problem.</i>

04:07.390 --> 04:09.280
How unusual.

04:09.280 --> 04:13.340
Most teachers try to gather 
as many students as possible.

04:13.810 --> 04:16.020
<i>I'd like to teach as carefully as possible.</i>

04:16.840 --> 04:18.720
Do you have a moment?

04:19.350 --> 04:24.070
Excuse me. I am Bright, a full-time lecturer.

04:26.230 --> 04:27.670
I see.

04:27.670 --> 04:30.680
You plan to teach a class 
focused on practical skills.

04:31.020 --> 04:34.490
<i>Yes, with an emphasis on magic.</i>

04:34.790 --> 04:39.560
I focus on classroom learning, 
but I also teach combat techniques.

04:39.950 --> 04:44.380
I'll send about ten of my students 
who seem interested your way.

04:44.780 --> 04:46.420
<i>Thank you.</i>

04:46.420 --> 04:49.630
This year is full of especially 
exceptional students.

04:49.630 --> 04:53.060
Some can even casting floating spells 
and communicate telepathically.

04:54.390 --> 04:56.530
<i>Is he including them?</i>

04:57.330 --> 04:59.100
<i>Exceptional, huh?</i>

04:59.100 --> 05:03.230
I hear you possess some 
outstanding abilities.

05:03.690 --> 05:05.660
I look forward to seeing what you do.

05:10.540 --> 05:12.320
<i>So this is the library.</i>

05:12.610 --> 05:14.670
May I help you?

05:15.870 --> 05:19.070
<i>My assistant is off submitting 
a request to use facilities,</i>

05:19.070 --> 05:21.360
<i>so I'm here to find materials for my class.</i>

05:21.360 --> 05:22.330
I see.

05:22.730 --> 05:24.860
I am the librarian here.

05:24.860 --> 05:27.680
If there are any books you're 
looking for, then I can help you.

05:28.070 --> 05:31.760
<i>In that case, do you have any 
books on magic incantations?</i>

05:31.760 --> 05:36.000
How rather bland for you, Kuzunoha-sama.

05:37.370 --> 05:41.080
Incredible. You instantly 
created a magical barrier.

05:41.080 --> 05:42.690
It's like a magician's trick.

05:43.180 --> 05:46.270
<i>Who are you? How do you know my name?</i>

05:46.270 --> 05:51.130
I'm a librarian. I know the teachers' names.

05:51.500 --> 05:54.110
<i>I heard the academy has 
hundreds of teachers.</i>

05:54.110 --> 05:56.910
<i>I find it hard to believe you learned 
a new teacher's name right away.</i>

05:58.110 --> 06:04.750
The truth is, I heard about you 
while eating with an exam proctor.

06:05.150 --> 06:07.190
<i>Is that really all?</i>

06:07.190 --> 06:11.480
Also, Luria of the Gotetsu 
Restaurant is my younger sister.

06:11.480 --> 06:12.380
<i>What?</i>

06:12.720 --> 06:17.420
I heard she has some unusual regulars 
who always order two hot pots.

06:17.420 --> 06:20.190
She said Shiki-sama likes their cream hot pot.

06:20.450 --> 06:22.800
In that case, when you get there, my—

06:22.800 --> 06:26.400
<i>She must've been trying to 
tell me about her sister.</i>

06:26.640 --> 06:29.860
<i>I see. Their faces certainly 
look similar, but...</i>

06:31.620 --> 06:32.880
Kuzunoha-sama...

06:33.240 --> 06:36.890
Men's gazes speak louder than their words.

06:36.890 --> 06:38.700
Do be careful.

06:38.700 --> 06:40.320
<i>S-Sorry...</i>

06:40.530 --> 06:43.800
Oh, were you imagining 
something inappropriate?

06:44.090 --> 06:45.510
<i>I put my foot in my mouth!</i>

06:46.780 --> 06:50.180
I'm joking. My name is Eva.

06:50.180 --> 06:52.300
I can usually be found at the counter.

06:52.300 --> 06:53.960
It's nice to meet you.

06:54.790 --> 06:57.770
<i>There's probably a lot of 
darkness behind that smile.</i>

06:57.770 --> 07:00.460
<i>She kind of seems like Mio.</i>

07:01.620 --> 07:05.570
Baretta, could you show me that again?

07:03.940 --> 07:06.900
<b></b>Harbor City of Koran

07:03.940 --> 07:06.900
<b></b>Harbor City of Koran

07:05.570 --> 07:06.900
A-Again?

07:07.210 --> 07:08.600
Of course.

07:08.600 --> 07:14.100
I'm working at this shop 
so I can learn to cook.

07:14.100 --> 07:18.740
Since you've paid the owner to study here,
 I suppose I don't have a choice.

07:19.280 --> 07:23.050
But promise me you won't swing a 
knife around the kitchen again.

07:23.050 --> 07:28.290
I only know how to use a knife 
in an eye-catching way.

07:28.750 --> 07:31.360
Anyway, here's how you do it.

07:32.400 --> 07:35.720
So you use the base of the knife 
to remove the eyes of the potato.

07:35.720 --> 07:39.130
The last time I cut a potato, 
they vanished completely.

07:40.470 --> 07:42.590
We'll start with the basics.

07:46.260 --> 07:47.510
Incredible.

07:47.510 --> 07:49.930
It's like a sheet of paper.

07:49.930 --> 07:52.810
The owner learned this technique in Laurel.

07:52.810 --> 07:54.620
It's apparently called rotary cutting.

07:54.620 --> 07:57.610
Rotary? What does that mean?

07:57.610 --> 07:59.820
I'm not sure exactly.

08:00.100 --> 08:04.870
Rotary cutting seems like it could 
be useful outside of cooking.

08:04.870 --> 08:06.290
Useful for what?

08:06.290 --> 08:08.750
<b></b>The Next Week ・ Rotsgard Academy

08:06.290 --> 08:08.750
<b></b>The Next Week ・ Rotsgard Academy

08:09.020 --> 08:11.900
Apparently our next lecturer 
communicates through writing.

08:11.900 --> 08:14.140
He's got some kind of assistant, too.

08:14.140 --> 08:17.860
That doesn't sound promising for a 
practical lesson on incantations.

08:17.860 --> 08:21.710
We have to attend his class 
since Bright-sensei told us to.

08:22.150 --> 08:24.720
I don't care what he does as 
long as it makes me stronger.

08:25.140 --> 08:27.200
And as long as he's not incompetent.

08:27.510 --> 08:29.560
<i>Is the teacher a demihuman?</i>

08:29.560 --> 08:31.090
<i>I heard he's hyuman.</i>

08:31.090 --> 08:33.000
<i>If he's ugly, I'm choosing another class.</i>

08:33.000 --> 08:34.640
<i>Dispel Listening Kai.</i>

08:34.660 --> 08:37.740
<b></b>Rotsgard Academy
 Practical Training Field

08:34.660 --> 08:37.740
<b></b>Rotsgard Academy
 Practical Training Field

08:35.150 --> 08:37.540
They don't take me seriously.

08:37.540 --> 08:40.140
Since your pay is determined by 
the number of students you have,

08:40.140 --> 08:42.870
it weakens your position as an instructor.

08:43.340 --> 08:47.780
Are you sure you don't want 
me to play the bad cop?

08:47.780 --> 08:51.080
If I'm nice to them, 
they'll never take me seriously.

08:51.760 --> 08:52.720
<b>Hmph</b>

08:51.970 --> 08:54.550
I'm going to be the scariest 
teacher I can be.

08:57.200 --> 08:58.210
Excuse me.

08:58.730 --> 09:01.800
Is this the right place for 
Kuzunoha-sensei's class?

09:01.800 --> 09:06.350
Yes. I'm his assistant, Shiki.

09:06.750 --> 09:09.720
We're planning to open a 
shop in town eventually.

09:09.720 --> 09:11.480
We hope you'll stop by.

09:11.480 --> 09:12.680
He's handsome.

09:12.680 --> 09:13.660
He seems nice.

09:13.660 --> 09:14.400
Right?

09:13.660 --> 09:14.940
And this is...

09:15.410 --> 09:18.570
<i>I'm Kuzunoha. I'm a merchant.</i>

09:18.570 --> 09:21.170
<i>I ran a caravan in the wasteland.</i>

09:21.390 --> 09:22.950
He's got a kobold face.

09:22.950 --> 09:24.240
How awful.

09:24.240 --> 09:25.540
This can't be good.

09:26.540 --> 09:31.390
<i>I'll be teaching a tough class focused on 
magic. Make sure you pay attention.</i>

09:31.680 --> 09:34.390
But I specialize in swordplay.

09:34.880 --> 09:39.040
<i>You there, how are your abilities 
with each of the elements?</i>

09:39.040 --> 09:41.110
I have an aptitude for wind.

09:41.320 --> 09:42.740
<i>And the others?</i>

09:42.740 --> 09:45.980
The others? I can use a bit of earth and fire.

09:46.380 --> 09:47.720
<i>What about you?</i>

09:47.720 --> 09:50.680
I can use fire and a bit of wind.

09:51.720 --> 09:55.570
<i>Is there anyone here who can use 
multiple elements at the same level?</i>

09:57.770 --> 10:00.240
<i>I'll take a page out of Tomoe's book here.</i>

10:00.920 --> 10:03.570
<i>I see now what you're capable of.</i>

10:04.030 --> 10:07.900
<i>Unfortunately, as things stand, 
you'll never be better than third-rate.</i>

10:07.900 --> 10:09.710
What? Third-rate?

10:09.710 --> 10:11.570
Aren't you being a bit harsh?

10:11.570 --> 10:14.250
We were admitted to the academy 
based on our abilities.

10:14.660 --> 10:16.570
<i>I simply spoke the truth.</i>

10:16.570 --> 10:22.460
Specializing in your best 
element is common practice.

10:22.460 --> 10:23.890
Yeah.

10:23.890 --> 10:25.060
That's normal.

10:25.060 --> 10:25.790
Right?

10:25.790 --> 10:31.440
<i>On the battlefield, if your one element 
is beaten, you'll be torn to shreds.</i>

10:31.440 --> 10:35.810
<i>At the very least, you must 
master three elements.</i>

10:36.450 --> 10:39.310
It's easy to describe how things should be.

10:39.710 --> 10:41.590
But are you capable of that, sir?

10:43.420 --> 10:46.120
<i>Shiki and I will conduct a mock battle.</i>

10:46.430 --> 10:50.290
<i>You can judge our power based on that.</i>

10:55.690 --> 10:57.220
Hey, that staff...

10:57.220 --> 10:58.830
It contains so much mana.

10:58.830 --> 11:00.500
Of various elements, too.

11:01.080 --> 11:02.720
<i>In contrast,</i>

11:03.240 --> 11:06.290
<i>I don't sense any mana from our instructor.</i>

11:07.080 --> 11:08.530
<i>Let's begin.</i>

11:08.530 --> 11:11.150
Thank you for letting me practice my 
skills against you, Kuzunoha-san.

11:12.040 --> 11:13.330
Here I come.

11:15.100 --> 11:16.970
He's fast. It's already ov—

11:20.550 --> 11:21.910
It's not over?

11:21.910 --> 11:24.590
That's a magical barrier.

11:26.390 --> 11:28.950
<i>You've gotten faster, Shiki.</i>

11:29.680 --> 11:32.710
<i>When we formed our contract, 
you could barely run.</i>

11:33.230 --> 11:36.700
<i>Tomoe-dono and Mio-dono trained me.</i>

11:36.700 --> 11:39.500
<i>Just the other day, 
I practiced running on water.</i>

11:39.850 --> 11:42.250
<i>What are those two making you do?</i>

11:48.870 --> 11:52.060
<i>An instant barrier. You're good.</i>

11:52.360 --> 11:55.300
<i>I appreciate the compliment.</i>

12:06.710 --> 12:07.880
<i>You're kidding, right?</i>

12:07.880 --> 12:10.320
<i>The teacher predicted his movements.</i>

12:10.690 --> 12:14.250
<i>Is this really a battle between mages?</i>

12:15.850 --> 12:17.370
<i>How about this?</i>

12:20.190 --> 12:22.770
<i>Damn it. Another counterspell.</i>

12:23.140 --> 12:25.250
<i>I'm impressed, Shiki.</i>

12:25.860 --> 12:28.670
After using earth, now he's using 
fire and water simultaneously.

12:28.670 --> 12:31.510
I can't believe how powerful 
their silent spells are.

12:32.800 --> 12:34.920
<i>It's because of my staff.</i>

12:34.920 --> 12:38.390
<i>The elder dwarves do good work.</i>

12:40.390 --> 12:42.700
<i>There's no point in letting this drag on.</i>

12:43.100 --> 12:45.250
<i>Let's end this with the next attack.</i>

12:45.950 --> 12:49.190
Heavenly light like sunshine, 
ultimate flames reflecting the sun...

12:49.190 --> 12:51.960
Voracious void, with the 
authority of shadows...

12:52.210 --> 12:54.480
They're speaking incantations 
for the first time.

12:54.480 --> 12:56.210
But I thought our teacher couldn't speak.

12:56.950 --> 12:58.320
Is that the ancient language?

12:58.920 --> 13:02.830
If their spells are that powerful 
without incantations, then with them...

13:11.720 --> 13:13.010
I am beaten.

13:23.060 --> 13:24.750
<i>Huh? Uh-oh.</i>

13:25.140 --> 13:27.100
<i>I might've scared them all off.</i>

13:28.050 --> 13:29.690
<i>That's all for today.</i>

13:30.340 --> 13:33.450
<i>Whether or not you'll show up 
for the next class is up to you.</i>

13:33.450 --> 13:35.670
<i>If you want to become stronger, 
you're welcome to join me.</i>

13:36.330 --> 13:38.930
<i>Shiki, I injured one of them.</i>

13:38.930 --> 13:41.430
<i>Could you heal the girl with the ponytail?</i>

13:41.960 --> 13:43.380
<i>Very well.</i>

13:44.060 --> 13:46.220
<i>He didn't let a single attack through.</i>

13:47.230 --> 13:49.270
Thank you for coming, everyone.

13:49.540 --> 13:51.160
Wh-What was that?

13:51.160 --> 13:52.720
I'm not taking a class with him!

13:52.720 --> 13:54.210
I'm scared. There's no way.

13:54.210 --> 13:56.140
That was so awesome!

13:56.140 --> 13:59.160
That last incantation wasn't chanted in Common.

13:59.160 --> 14:02.470
Was it Noble? No, Graf? Maybe even Weird?

14:03.280 --> 14:05.450
<i>That was terrifying.</i>

14:05.960 --> 14:10.910
<i>After talking down to him like that, 
I couldn't even avoid the debris.</i>

14:11.970 --> 14:13.630
Allow me.

14:15.580 --> 14:17.780
An ointment? Eek!

14:17.780 --> 14:20.550
Forgive me. That must've been cold.

14:21.320 --> 14:23.090
Huh? My wound...

14:23.410 --> 14:26.260
That must've been a pretty 
expensive magical medicine.

14:26.260 --> 14:30.110
At our shop, it's nothing special.

14:30.110 --> 14:31.760
I'm glad it didn't leave a scar.

14:36.500 --> 14:41.140
<i>What was Bright-sensei thinking 
when he referred us to him?</i>

14:41.590 --> 14:43.130
<i>I am so...</i>

14:43.620 --> 14:45.570
<i>grateful!</i>

14:45.960 --> 14:51.130
<i>For the first time since coming to the academy,
I might've met someone I can call master!</i>

14:52.120 --> 14:55.080
I'm worried about the next lesson.
 What do you think?

14:55.080 --> 14:56.870
I believe half will remain.

14:56.870 --> 14:58.330
I'm not sure.

14:58.330 --> 14:59.750
Anyway, what should I do about it?

15:00.220 --> 15:02.170
My face is stuck like this.

15:02.170 --> 15:04.220
I think you look nice and fierce.

15:05.470 --> 15:08.600
<i>I shouldn't copy Tomoe 
so much in the future.</i>

15:09.170 --> 15:13.140
<b></b>Around Star Lake

15:09.170 --> 15:13.140
<b></b>Around Star Lake

15:10.850 --> 15:13.130
You were on the battlefield, weren't you?

15:13.450 --> 15:15.310
That's right.

15:15.310 --> 15:21.150
I heard they're calling that lake 
formed by the battle Star Lake.

15:21.450 --> 15:24.110
We're being punished.

15:25.980 --> 15:31.440
He's punishing the hyumans 
for fighting the demons.

15:31.880 --> 15:33.510
You mean the Goddess?

15:33.510 --> 15:34.540
No.

15:35.280 --> 15:39.490
The Goddess always shows love to us hyumans.

15:39.980 --> 15:46.450
So when we stray from the right path, 
who admonishes and punishes us?

15:47.530 --> 15:50.620
That is his responsibility.

15:50.620 --> 15:53.990
The sorcerer dressed in blue and red.

15:54.860 --> 16:00.610
That's why he fired an arrow of punishment 
that destroys everything it touches.

16:00.610 --> 16:02.390
Arrow of punishment?

16:02.760 --> 16:05.850
Forgive me, but I'm going to 
take a look at your memories.

16:08.930 --> 16:12.790
I can't believe changing the scenery 
is his idea of annoying someone.

16:15.860 --> 16:19.940
There's never a dull moment 
with the young master.

16:20.490 --> 16:23.440
Now, what should I tell them?

16:26.040 --> 16:28.640
<i>I didn't think five would stick around.</i>

16:28.640 --> 16:30.120
I'm taking attendance.

16:30.390 --> 16:32.000
Mithra Casper.

16:32.000 --> 16:33.030
Here.

16:33.500 --> 16:37.960
<i>From Rotsgard. Both parents 
are affiliated with temples.</i>

16:37.960 --> 16:40.540
<i>His grades in classroom 
lectures are exceptional.</i>

16:41.360 --> 16:43.030
Daena Severus.

16:43.030 --> 16:44.500
Call me Daena.

16:44.500 --> 16:48.460
I married into my family name, 
and I'm still not used to it.

16:48.460 --> 16:50.290
<i>Despite how he seems, he's married.</i>

16:50.290 --> 16:52.800
<i>His wife is currently on maternity 
leave from the academy.</i>

16:53.160 --> 16:54.980
<i>He's only my age, too.</i>

16:55.310 --> 16:57.260
Abelia Hopleys.

16:57.260 --> 16:59.930
Here. You can call me Abelia.

16:59.930 --> 17:02.810
It can be a hassle otherwise.

17:02.810 --> 17:06.390
<i>If I recall correctly, 
there's another student named Hopleys.</i>

17:06.810 --> 17:09.920
<i>He's the son of an aristocratic 
family from Limia.</i>

17:10.240 --> 17:11.890
Izumo Kusakabe.

17:11.890 --> 17:12.900
Here.

17:12.900 --> 17:14.350
<i>An aspiring mage.</i>

17:14.350 --> 17:18.330
<i>His name sounds Japanese because 
he's from the Laurel Commonwealth.</i>

17:18.680 --> 17:19.950
Jin Rohan.

17:19.950 --> 17:20.720
Here.

17:21.110 --> 17:24.970
<i>An aspiring swordsman and top 
of his class in practical skills.</i>

17:24.970 --> 17:28.770
<i>My class is focused on magic. 
Is he sure he wants to be here?</i>

17:29.030 --> 17:32.550
Kuzunoha-sensei, normally you 
communicate through writing,

17:32.550 --> 17:35.520
but you spoke an incantation 
during our last class.

17:35.520 --> 17:37.730
<i>Oh, right. I confused them.</i>

17:38.310 --> 17:39.790
Allow me to make a correction.

17:39.790 --> 17:42.500
Common is the only language I can't speak.

17:42.690 --> 17:43.480
Huh?

17:43.480 --> 17:44.500
What language was that?

17:44.500 --> 17:49.750
That was, "Common is the only 
language I can't speak," right?

17:50.010 --> 17:53.860
<i>Right. Due to certain circumstances, 
Common is the only language I can't speak.</i>

17:54.290 --> 17:55.700
What kind of circumstances?

17:56.000 --> 17:57.850
<i>The lesson will now begin.</i>

17:58.290 --> 18:01.350
<i>What effect does spending 
mana have on the body?</i>

18:01.350 --> 18:05.420
Once a person has spent half their mana,

18:05.420 --> 18:07.760
they experience fatigue 
due to mental exhaustion.

18:07.760 --> 18:10.600
With only 20% left, they become lethargic.

18:10.600 --> 18:15.190
Spending all one's mana may cause vomiting 
and limited or loss of consciousness.

18:15.190 --> 18:17.740
Exceeding one's limits can result in death.

18:18.050 --> 18:21.700
That's a beginner lesson. 
Why are you asking us that now?

18:22.310 --> 18:26.220
<i>First, I'd like to identify 
your limits in battle.</i>

18:26.650 --> 18:29.120
<i>Keep in mind that injury is a possibility.</i>

18:29.120 --> 18:30.540
Battle?

18:30.540 --> 18:31.420
Injury?

18:31.700 --> 18:33.190
<i>Don't worry.</i>

18:33.190 --> 18:38.130
<i>I've got enough mana and stamina 
recovery medicines to sell.</i>

18:40.520 --> 18:43.940
<i>Now, all of you come at me 
with everything you've got.</i>

18:50.840 --> 18:53.480
I've never used this much magic before.

18:55.450 --> 18:58.370
Pierce my enemies, flame lance.

18:59.220 --> 19:01.320
Abelia, that's enough.

19:01.630 --> 19:03.280
I can keep—

19:06.830 --> 19:12.210
<i>I can tell the teacher's holding back, 
but each of his attacks is so heavy.</i>

19:12.780 --> 19:14.430
Huh? Healing magic?

19:14.770 --> 19:17.760
Jin, this is the last of my mana.

19:18.320 --> 19:19.470
Good luck.

19:20.320 --> 19:22.280
Don't leave me, Mithra!

19:22.280 --> 19:22.940
<i>Oh?</i>

19:23.660 --> 19:25.690
<i>Rather than prolonging 
the battle with defense,</i>

19:25.690 --> 19:27.850
<i>he's trusting the battle 
to the strongest fighter.</i>

19:27.850 --> 19:28.880
<i>A good choice.</i>

19:28.880 --> 19:30.660
Damn it. At least let me land one hit!

19:32.010 --> 19:33.020
<i>Your swings are too wide.</i>

19:33.400 --> 19:35.040
<i>Don't charge in recklessly.</i>

19:39.630 --> 19:40.880
Ow.

19:40.880 --> 19:42.960
My willpower isn't recovering.

19:42.960 --> 19:44.450
I couldn't land a single hit.

19:45.070 --> 19:47.420
I barfed in front of Shiki-san.

19:47.690 --> 19:51.670
Couldn't we have slowly 
worked up to this point?

19:52.040 --> 19:56.450
<i>Even if you know about limits, there's no 
point if you've never experienced them.</i>

19:56.710 --> 20:00.910
<i>Oh, right. Turn in a report 
on what you have to work on.</i>

20:01.700 --> 20:03.380
<i>He's evil!</i>

20:06.460 --> 20:09.880
That's match. The winner 
is Ilumgand Hopleys.

20:09.880 --> 20:13.500
You've been doing great 
recently, Ilumgand-san.

20:13.500 --> 20:14.230
Yeah.

20:15.000 --> 20:18.030
<i>This is a magical medicine being 
developed at the academy.</i>

20:18.460 --> 20:22.480
It dramatically improves your 
physical and magical abilities.

20:22.920 --> 20:25.010
Would you like to try it?

20:35.810 --> 20:37.330
<i>What's he doing here?</i>

20:38.280 --> 20:40.540
<i>He's not an academy instructor, is he?</i>

20:46.020 --> 20:48.970
Those students have more 
potential than I expected.

20:48.970 --> 20:50.780
Indeed.

20:50.780 --> 20:52.940
This one... Izumo, right?

20:53.430 --> 20:57.180
It's clear he's a mage. He was 
using some complex spells.

20:57.540 --> 21:01.480
Daena the married boy has a 
quick wit and good judgment.

21:01.480 --> 21:03.400
He's probably sharp.

21:03.980 --> 21:08.190
Abelia the lone girl uses her 
mana and physical strength well.

21:08.550 --> 21:14.030
Mithra the tall sacrificed 
himself to fight as a team.

21:14.490 --> 21:19.400
And finally, Jin remained standing until the 
end without expending all his stamina or mana.

21:20.560 --> 21:23.900
He was constantly checking on what 
and how the others were doing.

21:23.900 --> 21:25.240
He'd make a good leader.

21:25.240 --> 21:28.230
I'm impressed. You observed them closely.

21:28.890 --> 21:33.430
I'm not cut out to be a teacher,
 but I'll do my best.

21:33.430 --> 21:34.970
<i>Whatever it is,</i>

21:34.970 --> 21:36.470
<i>once I choose to do something,</i>

21:36.470 --> 21:37.750
<i>I will see it through.</i>

21:39.340 --> 21:43.910
The assassins' guild did a rather sloppy job.

21:44.360 --> 21:48.500
Not only were you beaten up by a mage, 
but he broke your weapon, too.

21:48.500 --> 21:51.430
Forgive me, but I wasn't 
told I'd be facing someone

21:51.430 --> 21:56.970
capable of shattering a blade made from 
the scales of the greater dragon Mitsurugi.

21:57.330 --> 21:59.200
I don't want to hear excuses.

21:59.720 --> 22:03.080
Get rid of that part-time 
teacher immediately.

23:35.750 --> 23:39.220
Night Six: "Becoming a Three-Star Chef."

23:35.890 --> 23:39.970
<b>Next Time</b>

23:36.890 --> 23:39.970
<b>Becoming a Three-Star Chef</b>
